      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”是中距离GＩ的最高峰──\n不光是经典级，还有古马级的厉害选手参赛，\n是一场非常高水准的GⅠ比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4078cc2245e222855159afddddeffdc8d5bc2c721fe4e44252d7175f5a0c0d67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002306.json",
      "json_path": [
